      "message": "Hi Poornima,\n\nI\u0027m not sure if this is a right generic solution yet. enable_i2c_raw_mode and board_pre_task_i2c_peripheral_init may also need to run board specific code.\n\nHave you thought of initializing i2c separately in a HOOK_INIT callback? Maybe your board can set i2c_ports_used to the number which is common to all variants. Then, a HOOK_INIT callback can change it to a board specific value. You may need to add i2c_init_port(int port) to allow a board to init a specific port.\n\nWDYT?",
